Version 1.0 is now LIVE! It includes Steam Achievements, Languages, Bug Fixes, Treasure Chests and more.

New:
[list]
    [*] 16 Steam Achievements;
    [*] Languages: English, French, German, Italian, Japanese, Korean, Russian, Spanish, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese;
    [*] Treasure Chests all over the island to reward players for exploring the island;
    [*] "Tower Defence" of your home from zombies;
    [*] New animal/zombie spawn system;
[/list]

Fixes:
[list]
    [*] Balance fixes;
    [*] Fixed animal's/zombie's health system;
    [*] Fixed ragdoll issues;
    [*] Fixed zombie spawn;
    [*] Improved perfomance;
[/list]

